<resources>
    <!-- Message shown during fingerprint acquisision when the fingerprint cannot be recognized -->
    <string name="fingerprint_acquired_partial">ກະລຸນາກວດສອບໃຫ້ໝັ້ນໃຈວ່ານິ້ວຂອງທ່ານແຕະຢູ່ເຊັນເຊີ</string>

    <!-- Message shown during fingerprint acquisision when the user removes their finger from the sensor too quickly -->
    <string name="fingerprint_acquired_too_fast">ວາງນິ້ວຂອງທ່ານໄວ້ຢູ່ເຊັນເຊີຕໍ່ອີກໜ້ອຍໜຶ່ງ</string>

    <!-- Message shown during fingerprint acquisition when a Power press has been detected.[CHAR LIMIT=50] -->
    <string name="fingerprint_acquired_power_press">ເພື່ອສືບຕໍ່ຕັ້ງຄ່າ, ໃຫ້ສຳຜັດເຊັນເຊີເບົາໆ</string>

    <!-- Generic error message shown when the power button has been pressed. [CHAR LIMIT=150] -->
    <string name="fingerprint_error_power_pressed">ສິ້ນສຸດການຢັ້ງຢືນແລ້ວ. ລອງສຳຜັດເບົາໆຄັ້ງຕໍ່ໄປ.</string>

    <!-- Content of concurrent display thermal notification. [CHAR LIMIT=NONE] -->
    <string name="concurrent_display_notification_thermal_content">Dual Screen ບໍ່ພ້ອມໃຫ້ນຳໃຊ້ເນື່ອງຈາກໂທລະສັບ Pixel ຂອງທ່ານຮ້ອນເກີນໄປ</string>
</resources>
